        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[How to Paint Ferren Areios | Warhammer 40,000]]></title>
            <link>https://www.warhammer-community.com/en-gb/videos/boqi1lan/how-to-paint-ferren-areios-warhammer-40000</link>
            <guid>boqi1lan</guid>
            <pubDate>Wed, 19 Nov 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[Ferren Areios, Captain of the Ultramarines’ 6th Company, is a warrior forged in the fires of the Indomitus Crusade. Chosen by the Primarch to lead his brothers in battle, the Master of Rites fights for the survival of Humanity and the realm of Ultramar. Tune in to this paint guide to see Ollie show you how to paint this awesome new character quickly and easily!

If you enjoyed this and want to learn more, our YouTube channel has an array of beginner-friendly videos to get you started.]]></description>
            <category domain="painting">Painting</category>
            <category domain="videos">Videos</category>
